			"notes": "Fabric builds for Minecraft 26.1.2, 26.2 and 26.3. Download only the jar matching your Minecraft version. Requires Java 25, Fabric API and Fabric Language Kotlin.\n\n- Select official UniversalCraft and Fabric API dependencies per target.\n- Adapt screen ownership and HUD hooks for 26.2/26.3, and cursor release for the 26.3 SDL backend.\n- Repair the obsolete main-thread packet mixin target.\n- Build all three versions on GitHub hosted runners and include all three installable jars in releases.\n\nVerified: clean Gradle build and bytecode mixin contracts on all three versions; actual Fabric mixin transformation smoke checks across 12 target classes on all three versions. No live Hypixel gameplay test was performed.\n\nThe optional Essential partner marketing integration has no published 26.3 artifact and is omitted only from the 26.3 build; Skytils features and its UI remain included."
